# Built cockpit dashes: cut from a donor car model by tools/build-cockpit.mjs.
# Held out of git while the cut is still changing — each build is ~68 MB (4K)
# and ~23 MB (1K), binaries do not delta, and every rebuild would add another
# full copy to history forever. The manifests beside them ARE committed: they
# are small, and they record the role -> node mapping and the measured steering
# axis that game/cockpitmodel.ts binds against.
# Rebuild with:
#   node tools/build-cockpit.mjs <donor.glb>
#   node tools/build-cockpit.mjs <donor.glb> --out volvo-s90-mobile --tex 1024
public/models/cockpits/*.glb
